abstract: >-
  Python code and frozen numerical outputs supporting the
  reproducibility of the stylised computational pilot associated with the
  manuscript "A socio-cybernetic architecture for rare-disease governance based
  on social systems theory". The repository does not contain the manuscript or
  journal-submission files.
